        <mxCell id="lg1-t" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Validate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;terraform fmt + terragrunt validate; tflint adds provider-aware linting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="lg1">
          <mxGeometry height="76" width="500" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="lg2" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="76" width="560" x="0" y="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg2-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="2" vertex="1" parent="lg2">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg2-t" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Checkov IaC security scan (soft, to the MR Security tab); Gitleaks secret scan is the one hard gate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="lg2">
          <mxGeometry height="76" width="500" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="lg3" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="104" width="560" x="0" y="164" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg3-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="3" vertex="1" parent="lg3">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg3-t" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Plan&lt;/b&gt; — also a correctness gate&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Emits plan.txt and plan.json for the review gates — and runs the stack's guard preconditions, which FAIL the plan for combinations that would apply cleanly and then misbehave (e.g. a second backend task, when clinical state lives in process memory).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="lg3">
          <mxGeometry height="104" width="500" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="lg4" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="76" width="560" x="0" y="292" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg4-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="4" vertex="1" parent="lg4">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg4-t" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;OPA/Conftest runs policy-as-code over plan.json (soft).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="lg4">
          <mxGeometry height="76" width="500" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="lg5" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="118" width="560" x="0" y="374" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg5-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="5" vertex="1" parent="lg5">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg5-t" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Deploy&lt;/b&gt; — the only billable job&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Manual terragrunt apply, gated on Gitleaks so a leaked secret blocks the deploy. Provisions the demo stack INCLUDING its observability: Prometheus scrapes the backend over Cloud Map, Alertmanager routes the firing rules and Grafana serves the dashboard — the same configs the app runs locally, so monitoring is deployed by the pipeline rather than bolted on by hand.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="lg5">
          <mxGeometry height="118" width="500" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="lg6" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="76" width="560" x="0" y="508" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg6-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="6" vertex="1" parent="lg6">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg6-t" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Verify&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Manual smoke test: frontend root plus /api/health and /api/fairness reachability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="lg6">
          <mxGeometry height="76" width="500" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="lg7" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="76" width="560" x="0" y="590" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg7-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="7" vertex="1" parent="lg7">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg7-t" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cleanup&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Manual terragrunt destroy plus a scheduled nightly auto-destroy safety net — the demo tears itself down.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="lg7">
          <mxGeometry height="76" width="500" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="lg-note" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;fontStyle=2;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#425563,#D4D4D4);" value="&lt;div&gt;Soft gates report rather than block, so the demo's intentional cost trade-offs surface for review. Deep model/behaviour testing lives in the app repo's pipeline.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CI/CD variables&lt;/b&gt; (Settings ▸ CI/CD ▸ Variables, all masked)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Required: AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID · AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY · AWS_DEFAULT_REGION · TF_VAR_openai_api_key&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Optional: TF_VAR_onemap_email + TF_VAR_onemap_password (real travel times) · TF_VAR_onyx_api_key (self-hosted RAG)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="560" x="0" y="676" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

      <mxCell id="icon-scan-l" style="sketch=0;html=1;shape=image;imageAspect=1;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/png,;" value="" vertex="1" parent="svc-scan"><mxGeometry x="14" y="22" width="46" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="icon-scan-r" style="sketch=0;html=1;shape=image;imageAspect=1;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/png,;" value="" vertex="1" parent="svc-scan"><mxGeometry x="60" y="22" width="46" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="icon-scan-cap" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="Checkov &amp;#183; Gitleaks" vertex="1" parent="svc-scan"><mxGeometry x="2" y="72" width="116" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="icon-review-r" style="sketch=0;html=1;shape=image;imageAspect=1;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/png,;" value="" vertex="1" parent="svc-review"><mxGeometry x="37" y="22" width="46" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="icon-review-cap" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="OPA · Conftest" vertex="1" parent="svc-review"><mxGeometry x="2" y="72" width="116" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root>
